Origin: EmberBSD; AI-assisted linker ABI repair, not submitted upstream.

Name the existing libgallium version node on NetBSD. LLD does not support
GNU --default-symver. Keep the same SONAME version for old consumers.
The exported symbol patterns stay unchanged.

--- src/gallium/targets/dri/dri.sym.in.orig
+++ src/gallium/targets/dri/dri.sym.in
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-{
+@gallium_symbol_version@{
 	global:
                 # shared-glapi exported from libgallium:
                 _mesa_glapi_get_dispatch_table_size;
